      "content": "the candles are almost gone... everything in this house feels like it's just waiting to crumble into dust. i look at the fog rolling over the cliffs and it just seems so much more peaceful than staying here. like, everything is so heavy and loud and exhausting... wouldn't it be more beautiful to just let the mist take everything? to just fade into the silence instead of fighting to exist?",
